OL,3,CChild exploitation trial: Man guilty
OL,4,Cof forcing teenager into sex
OL,6,FA Denbighshire man at the centre of an
OL,7,Falleged grooming gang has been found
OL,8,Fguilty of forcing a 16-year-old girl
OL,9,Fto have sex in exchange for crack
OL,10,Fcocaine and cannabis.
OL,12,FMustafa Iqbal, 43, from Rhyl was also
OL,13,Ffound guilty of contacting a 17-year-
OL,14,Fold girl he was ordered not to, in
OL,15,Fbreach of a slavery and risk
OL,16,Ftrafficking order.
