OL,3,CChild exploitation trial: Man guilty
OL,4,Cof forcing teenager into sex
OL,6,FIqbal faces further charges including
OL,7,Fthe rape of a 15-year-old and 16-year-
OL,8,Fold girl and the sexual assault of a
OL,9,F14-year-old. He denies the allegations
OL,10,Fagainst him.
OL,12,FHe is one of four men charged in
OL,13,Fconnection with child sexual
OL,14,Fexploitation. The defendants have all
OL,15,Fpleaded not guilty to the charges
OL,16,Fagainst them.
OL,18,FThe trial at Caernarfon Crown Court
OL,19,Fcontinues.
